                        ],
                        "form": "rosbifs"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6d6f9f87-8370-4ea3-9375-a91bdfa109b0",
                        "entry_id": "a31462ff-94a3-351c-9c41-ef4275a57314",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "roast-beef"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "82166f42-4ede-4317-9de9-949f4ec74c74",
                        "entry_id": "a31462ff-94a3-351c-9c41-ef4275a57314",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "rosbeef"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "555924d5-eb5f-3751-819d-5c8d2a0dc105",
                        "entry_id": "a31462ff-94a3-351c-9c41-ef4275a57314",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Viande de bœuf rôtie, et particulièrement l’aloyau."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87988df3-2639-4be2-9f44-d8cc566f100a",
                                "sense_id": "555924d5-eb5f-3751-819d-5c8d2a0dc105",
                                "text": "Vingt minutes avant de retirer le rosbif du feu, déballez-le pour en colorer les surfaces, débrochez-le sur un plafond, salez-le, tenez-le à l’étuve pendant une demi-heure; cette station à l’étuve attendrit singulièrement les viandes de bœuf rôties."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d91a4218-2c09-4a39-a5c1-0aa72861cdae",
                                "sense_id": "555924d5-eb5f-3751-819d-5c8d2a0dc105",
                                "text": "La viande, qui doit se révéler un peu ferme, provient souvent de tranche grasse, de rond de gîte, de gîte à la noix, mais les rosbifs aristocratiques peuvent être taillés dans le filet, le faux-filet ou le romsteck."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0b2ce6e-be88-4c1b-b9b7-be593e61b7ac",
                                "sense_id": "555924d5-eb5f-3751-819d-5c8d2a0dc105",
                                "text": "Philippine avait mis la main sur un rosbif et Arminius avait sorti trois bouteilles de château-l’évangile de la cave."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1e54d01a-ebdd-38b3-9541-faa5f82dd4af",
                        "entry_id": "a31462ff-94a3-351c-9c41-ef4275a57314",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anglais."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "offensive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c13341e-9942-4662-8701-44f65ea7f950",
                                "sense_id": "1e54d01a-ebdd-38b3-9541-faa5f82dd4af",
                                "text": "Quoique Johnson sût assez de français pour se tirer d’affaire, on le reconnaissait assez facilement pour un rosbif et nous n’étions pas toujours trop bien venus ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42845ea9-3e6e-4b27-b12c-f19832915136",
                                "sense_id": "1e54d01a-ebdd-38b3-9541-faa5f82dd4af",
                                "text": "Elle était quand même rudement jolie, celle-là. Bien mieux que l’autre misérable rosbif de Bébour !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4841119-89ef-4fc7-889e-8fc2a85eb922",
                        "source_entry_id": "a31462ff-94a3-351c-9c41-ef4275a57314",
                        "source_sense_description": "Viande",
                        "target_lang_word": "Roastbeef",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Roastbeef",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5c65c64-0884-32ac-9ee0-35eb21347064",
                                        "entry_id": "f2f05124-ee16-387d-a760-cdee048c93e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Teilstück des Hinterviertels vom Rind"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4ca9962-a36a-4182-a194-0438cfef961e",
                                                "sense_id": "d5c65c64-0884-32ac-9ee0-35eb21347064",
                                                "text": "„Zum Frühstück hielt er bei einer Union-76-Raststätte und beobachtete einige Trucker, die in dem für sie reservierten Teil des Lokals vor Tellern mit Steaks und Eiern, Roastbeef, Hackbraten, gegrillten Hühnchen und panierten Schnitzeln saßen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e0c75f2-d49e-4798-918c-2638d944222d",
                                                "sense_id": "d5c65c64-0884-32ac-9ee0-35eb21347064",
                                                "text": "„›Roastbeef, gibt’s selten‹, erwidert der Cop und zeigt stolz auf die zweite Hälfte seines Sandwichs.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3473b6a1-ef53-4748-bfbd-7ed81c757a1c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a31462ff-94a3-351c-9c41-ef4275a57314",
                        "source_sense_description": "Viande",
                        "target_lang_word": "roast beef",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "roast beef",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34bdc689-6777-3d27-bc9b-32fb078c56f3",
                                        "entry_id": "be1f166d-f4a0-3b22-854c-91094249f546",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beef cooked by roasting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "250d20ee-e523-34de-95aa-236def89cdc8",
                                        "entry_id": "be1f166d-f4a0-3b22-854c-91094249f546",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cut of beef that has been roasted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2f1364b-f5ee-4cac-b18d-4e1bb0113b08",
                                                "sense_id": "250d20ee-e523-34de-95aa-236def89cdc8",
                                                "text": "I tell the waiter, 'We'll have two roast beefs, one well-done, the other medium rare.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44125caf-b3c3-44e5-a185-d8ef9205fc33",
                                                "sense_id": "250d20ee-e523-34de-95aa-236def89cdc8",
                                                "text": "But the cars & trucks held cartons of roast chickens, slabs of cheeses, loaves of bread, racks of hotdogs, case upon case of soft drinks, cases of bottled sparkling water, pies, cakes, roast beefs & baked hams."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6834e778-0850-44ac-b456-25655c15c2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "250d20ee-e523-34de-95aa-236def89cdc8",
                                                "text": "No delicate little tidbits at these parties; there are buckets of shrimps and oysters, roast beefs and hams and tables of sweets with smiling corporate heads and their lobbyists to greet the guests."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ad08824-f2c3-3bc4-989c-9146fe28468a",
                                        "entry_id": "be1f166d-f4a0-3b22-854c-91094249f546",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cut of beef intended for roasting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4d87134-e8a4-4433-aa9f-44490380c96f",
                                                "sense_id": "7ad08824-f2c3-3bc4-989c-9146fe28468a",
                                                "text": "Two or three times a week I had to deliver fifteen- or twenty-pound roast beefs to delis around the Bronx so that they could cook them and slice them up for sandwiches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3d751b6-8730-4030-8aa8-bd43cafe8450",
                                                "sense_id": "7ad08824-f2c3-3bc4-989c-9146fe28468a",
                                                "text": "We had a freezer up until maybe two years ago. We used to pack a lot of roast beefs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "95df960f-1a23-3ab6-8a28-e04262474b39",
                                        "entry_id": "be1f166d-f4a0-3b22-854c-91094249f546",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A portion of roasted beef."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e4c38e4-ca16-4e5b-8428-60aeb615a427",
                                                "sense_id": "95df960f-1a23-3ab6-8a28-e04262474b39",
                                                "text": "Because there, in the middle of the table, among the roast beefs on rolls,[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1126334d-dd80-46a5-b4cc-cd874c81190b",
